./contributingGuides/TestRail_Navigation_C+.md-8-## Navigating TestRail
./contributingGuides/TestRail_Navigation_C+.md-9-- Expensify's TestRail account is broken down into four projects. For the purpose of this document, we will focus on the project titled `NewDot - New Expensify (New Format)`. Click on this project.
