./README.md:171:Unit tests are valuable when you want to test one component. They should be short, fast, and ideally only test one thing.
./README.md:172:Often times in order to write a unit test, you may need to mock data, a component, or library. We use the library [Jest](https://jestjs.io/)
./README.md-173-to help run our Unit tests.
