./README.md-203-# Release Profiler
./README.md-204-Often, performance issue debugging occurs in debug builds, which can introduce errors from elements such as JS Garbage Collection, Hermes debug markers, or LLDB pauses.
./README.md-205-
./README.md-206-`react-native-release-profiler` facilitates profiling within release builds for accurate local problem-solving and broad performance analysis in production to spot regressions or collect extensive device data. Therefore, we will utilize the production build version
./README.md-207-
./README.md-208-### Getting Started with Source Maps
./README.md-209-To accurately profile your application, generating source maps for Android and iOS is crucial. Here's how to enable them:
./README.md-210-1. Enable source maps on Android
